{"id":"ca73860b6bd23779","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-ce-schnorr-dimension-zero.md","title":"c.e. 集的 Schnorr Hausdorff 维数为零","display":"thm-ce-schnorr-dimension-zero — c.e. 集的 Schnorr Hausdorff 维数为零","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-ce-schnorr-dimension-zero","aliases":["43-thm-ce-schnorr-dimension-zero"],"display":"thm-ce-schnorr-dimension-zero — c.e. 集的 Schnorr Hausdorff 维数为零","depends_on":["[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-schnorr-dimensions]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 17.10.4","source_printed_pages":"541–542","source_pdf_pages":"561–562","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-ce-schnorr-dimension-zero"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-ce-schnorr-dimension-zero</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-schnorr-dimension-zero — c.e. 集的 Schnorr Hausdorff 维数为零"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cfc6a383edf25e5\" href=\"?note=6cfc6a383edf25e5\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-dimensions\">43-df-schnorr-dimensions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 17.10.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"541–542"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"561–562"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{SH}\">\\(\\dim_{SH}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6cfc6a383edf25e5\" href=\"?note=6cfc6a383edf25e5\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-dimensions\">43-df-schnorr-dimensions</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\dim_{SH}(\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A))=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\dim_{SH}(\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A))=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 c.e. 自然数集合的结论；左 c.e. 实数的二进制位集一般不是 c.e. 集。原文通过长区间的枚举密度构造可计算鞅，未将其完整证明标为本轮已核验。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 17.10.4，印刷页 541–542，PDF 页 561–562。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","